---
title: GoodsReceipt State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : Warehouse Keeper creates goods receipt (published products only, idempotent)
    Pending --> Received : Admin approves, batches created, PurchaseReceipt transaction raises OnHand
    Pending --> Rejected : Admin rejects (rejection reason required, no stock change)
    Received --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
